    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to escape from the stress of urban life? <strong>Nom Nom: Cozy Forest Caf\u00e9</strong> is a cozy and relaxing decoration and rhythm game where you manage a caf\u00e9 and befriend cute animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low stress, non confrontational, relaxing experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your own cafeteria:</strong> Customize your place with furniture, decorations, lamps, wallpaper, and flooring. Take pictures of your favourite corners, dishes, and customers and share them on the caf\u00e9's website.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/53dba7b3762f4f55b93d5be3829770ba.poster.avif?t=1744369737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/53dba7b3762f4f55b93d5be3829770ba.webm?t=1744369737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/53dba7b3762f4f55b93d5be3829770ba.mp4?t=1744369737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorable customers:</strong> Forge friendships and learn about their favourite recipes and decorations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/fd27d4b1b74b1aaaef30f5ccf45e5e78.poster.avif?t=1744369737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/fd27d4b1b74b1aaaef30f5ccf45e5e78.webm?t=1744369737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/fd27d4b1b74b1aaaef30f5ccf45e5e78.mp4?t=1744369737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn new recipes... To the beat!</strong> Prepare snacks and drinks, from waffles to sodas, to the rhythm of upbeat tunes and colourful animations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/79ead9ef817b311b9f079f25d926878d.poster.avif?t=1744369737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/79ead9ef817b311b9f079f25d926878d.webm?t=1744369737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/79ead9ef817b311b9f079f25d926878d.mp4?t=1744369737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity! Practice your skills whenever you like. Experiment with new ingredient combinations and sell them in your own vending machine to earn rewards!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/573527d54f376ef044bc141f88724899.poster.avif?t=1744369737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/573527d54f376ef044bc141f88724899.webm?t=1744369737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/573527d54f376ef044bc141f88724899.mp4?t=1744369737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick up your customer's hobbies!</strong> Learn your customers' favourite crafts. Flower arranging, friendship bracelets, slime... and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/689878224f1a0a307ccfc8af28d277b5.avif?t=1744369737\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to escape from the stress of urban life? <strong>Nom Nom: Cozy Forest Caf\u00e9</strong> is a cozy and relaxing decoration and rhythm game where you manage a caf\u00e9 and befriend cute animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low stress, non confrontational, relaxing experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your own cafeteria:</strong> Customize your place with furniture, decorations, lamps, wallpaper, and flooring. Take pictures of your favourite corners, dishes, and customers and share them on the caf\u00e9's website.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/53dba7b3762f4f55b93d5be3829770ba.poster.avif?t=1744369737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/53dba7b3762f4f55b93d5be3829770ba.webm?t=1744369737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/53dba7b3762f4f55b93d5be3829770ba.mp4?t=1744369737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorable customers:</strong> Forge friendships and learn about their favourite recipes and decorations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/fd27d4b1b74b1aaaef30f5ccf45e5e78.poster.avif?t=1744369737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/fd27d4b1b74b1aaaef30f5ccf45e5e78.webm?t=1744369737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.ak